      "problem": "Expand $(x + 3)(x - 3).$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the difference of square formula:\n\n$$\n(a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=x$ and $b=3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t(x + 3)(x - 3) &= \\[5pt]\n\t\tx^2 - 3^2 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\tx^2 - 9.\n\t}\n$$",
